event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_05bdf50b00291e09016acad0a9e00c8190b50d5b1574147c02","output_index":0,"sequence_number":78,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing static app API**\n\nI'm looking into implementing a simple served static browser app API. My first steps involve running tests, checking if we need a temporary database, and ensuring HTTP restart functionalities are in place. Since there might not be a browser available, I'm wondering if unit and integration tests would suffice. Thankfully, I have ample time to work through these tasks. Let's move forward with this plan!"}

